tps://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-07-29T13:12:09Z","updated_at":"2019-07-29T13:12:09Z","body":"For these files Mp3Extractor calculates the duration based on Bitrate.\r\n\r\nFor MpegAudioHeader, Exoplayer estimates the bitrate based on Sample Rate and Samples per frame. Here instead of bitrate 128,000 bps, it is setting the value to 127,706 bps. This is causing the total duration shown for the files to be different.\r\n\r\n`bitrate = 8 * frameSize * sampleRate / samplesPerFrame;`\r\n\r\n[Link](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/71f72c59537711399dc5496136dd6b867acc6d77/library/core/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/extractor/MpegAudioHeader.java#L192) to above snippet.\r\nSample Rate = 44,100, Frame Size 417, Samples per frame 1152 for the MP3 files in the playlist.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/515985327/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"umangsaini","id":51775549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzc1NTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51775549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini","html_url":"https://github.com/umangsaini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/umangsaini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/516056054","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6238#issuecomment-516056054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6238","id":516056054,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxNjA1NjA1NA==","user":{"login":"SteMora","id":8629721,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2Mjk3MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8629721?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora","html_url":"https://github.com/SteMora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-07-29T16:08:32Z","updated_at":"2019-07-29T16:08:32Z","body":"Thanks for the answer.\r\n\r\nWhile debugging at running time, the frameSize seems to be inconsistent du to a `padding` switching from 1 to 0 value.\r\n\r\n```\r\npadding        : 0\r\nframeSize      : 417\r\nsampleRate     : 44100\r\nsamplesPerFrame: 1152\r\nbitrate        : 127706\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\npadding        : 1\r\nframeSize      : 418\r\nsampleRate     : 44100\r\nsamplesPerFrame: 1152\r\nbitrate        : 128012\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith the google sample file, the problem seems to also happened in the same way. \r\n\r\nThe error happens mostly on the playing start, then it stabilises on correct values.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/516056054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"SteMora","id":8629721,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2Mjk3MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8629721?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora","html_url":"https://github.com/SteMora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteMora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2526156231,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQyNTI2MTU2MjMx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/2526156231","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id